    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338800/extras/bb3f9e9ae9330054f67e74e60817495f.avif?t=1714352248\" /></span><br><br>An epidemic strikes, and the city enters a state of lockdown. As a community volunteer, what would you do in the face of a shortage of supplies?<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >grow vegetables or fruit</h2></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338800/extras/ac69587c42cc830d9be3f338d1a408f3.avif?t=1714352248\" /></span><br><br>Vegetables or fruits can be grown in the vegetable garden on the roof.<br>Wait for the crops to ripen to sell or make dishes by taking good care of them!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >raising livestock</h2></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338800/extras/fe8e6f61fcfa9dae1c480eab5b270f72.avif?t=1714352248\" /></span><br><br>Animals such as chickens and fishs can be raised on the rooftop facility.<br>After careful feeding, the bred animals will continue to produce eggs and meat!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gathering and Fishing</h2></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338800/extras/094da08369d485c1ac183c65a55d80bc.avif?t=1714352248\" /></span><br><br>The green space and landscape pool in the community will provide you with a lot of wild vegetables and fish!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >enhance relationship</h2></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338800/extras/932f2a622399699d49bc984c7d110ac4.avif?t=1714352248\" /></span><br><br>Meet the various needs of residents in the community!<br>As your relationship deepens, you can unlock various facilities in the game and gain abilities.<br><br>Maintain an optimistic attitude, and work together with the residents of the community to tide over the difficulties.",
